# Media Downloader – Links File
# =============================
# One URL per line.  Optionally add "audio" or "video" after the URL.
# Default format is "audio" if not specified.
#
# Supported platforms:
#   - YouTube  (youtube.com, youtu.be)
#   - Instagram (instagram.com)
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments.
# Lines ending with ' ✓' are already downloaded (auto-marked by the script).
#
# Examples:
# https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ audio
# https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ video
# https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ
# https://www.instagram.com/reel/ABC123/ audio
# https://www.instagram.com/reel/ABC123/ video
# https://www.instagram.com/p/XYZ789/ audio
